# FULL PEAL: A is the forward gun (the owner's layout: the original has it on
# Button 1, our B). Held, it fires again and again straight
# into the distance down the lane the ship is in, and hits whatever is out
# there in that lane (generously: a little into the lanes either side
# counts), and nothing in the other lanes. Foes that have reached the
# ship's plane are past it: the forward gun can't touch them.
game fullpeal
wait 12
press A
cheat sandbox
cheat god
cheat still
# the ship in column 3, row 2
cheat pos 0.5 0.5
expect col == 3
expect row == 2
cheat foez 0 0.5 0.5 0.6
cheat foez 0 -1.5 -0.5 0.6
expect foes == 2
hold A 40
expect fired_fwd >= 5
expect foes == 1
expect kind_x100_0 == -150
expect wave_kills == 1
# a tenor takes three
cheat foez 1 0.5 0.5 0.8
hold A
waituntil kind_hp_1 == 2 40
expect foes_1 == 1
waituntil foes_1 == 0 60
release
# a foe just over the line into the next lane still counts
cheat foez 0 1.2 0.5 0.7
hold A 40
expect foes_0 == 1
expect kind_x100_0 == -150
# but one two lanes over doesn't
cheat foez 0 2.0 0.5 0.7
hold A 40
expect foes_0 == 2
# a foe on the plane in the very lane: the shots go past it
cheat foez 0 0.5 0.5 0
hold A 60
expect foes_0 == 3
expect kind_hp_0 == 1
